  "known_limitations": [
    "The performance profile is a repeatable production Chromium/Canvas2D stress proxy with disclosed launch flags and a 768x600 viewport; it is not a physical integrated-GPU certification.",
    "The current production bundle includes Phaser in a 1.336 MB minified JavaScript chunk, so Vite emits its non-blocking 500 kB chunk-size advisory.",
